promise_out_of_map.vlt:17:15: error: `get` would copy a `Promise<string>` out of the `Map`
  = note: TypeScript allows this, but a Velt promise has one owner (`await` takes its result) and can't be copied or shared: store the awaited result (`m.set(k, await p)`), or keep the promises in an array and take them out with `pop()`
